# mod-custom-spells: the Priest lines of the third concept list
# (operator 2026-10-31; share-public
# custom-spells/records/2026-10-31-third-concept-list.md), wave 1 = the
# spell modifiers, wave 2 (the end of the file) = procs and stacking buffs.
# Every check states the list's line, so a FAIL marks a defect.
# Test ground: map 13, the FL dummy arena - eight AoE Training Dummies
# (920018) on a 4-yd circle around (-270, 150); d1 = the west-most one. The
# bot stands west of the ring facing it.
# Spells: Penance 53007 (talent; heal ticks 52985, damage ticks 52998),
# Holy Nova 48078 (heal 48076), Mind Sear 53023 (tick 53022).
name    Custom spells - Priest third list
timeout 360s

bot pr priest slot=4
bot ally warrior

place 13 -279 150 -423.2 0
require pr alive
pick d1 creature:920018 near pr
require d1 exists
do gm target pr
as gm .unlearn 900907
as gm .unlearn 900944
as gm .unlearn 900977
as gm .unlearn 900908
as gm .unlearn 900910
as gm .unlearn 900945
as gm .unlearn 900946
as gm .unlearn 900947
as gm .unlearn 900978
as gm .unlearn 900980
as gm .unaura 900909
as gm .unaura 900911
as gm .unaura 900979
as gm .unaura 48168
as gm .unaura 48111
do pr learn 53007
do pr learn 48078
do pr learn 53023

log Control - without the passives nothing is modified
expect pr spellmod 52985 damage 100 == 100
expect pr spellmod 48078 damage 100 == 100

log Discipline - 900907 "penance +50% healing": the heal ticks only, the damage ticks stay
do pr learn 900907
expect pr spellmod 52985 damage 100 == 150
expect pr spellmod 52998 damage 100 == 100

log Holy - 900944 "holy nova damage/heal +50%": both parts
do pr learn 900944
expect pr spellmod 48078 damage 100 == 150
expect pr spellmod 48076 damage 100 == 150

log Shadow - 900977 "mind sear +50% dmg": the damage tick (a direct damage spell)
do pr learn 900977
expect pr spellmod 53022 damage 100 == 150

# ================================================================ wave 2
# Procs and stacking buffs (agent C, 2026-10-31). Spells: Mana Burn 8129
# (10 % of the target's mana), Kobold Geomancer 476 (level 7-8, hostile, a mana
# user), Inner Fire rank 9 48168 (20 charges, lost when hit), Combat Tester
# 11080 (level 60, hostile, 305,200 health, melee only, fights only when
# attacked: it hits the priest in melee), Smite 48123, Flash Heal 48071
# (1.5-s cast), Prayer of Mending rank 3 48113 (aura 48111, heal 33110),
# Emberseer Bonus Damage 16534 (2000 physical damage to ITS CASTER: whoever
# casts it hurts himself), Full Heal 25840, Divine Hymn 64843 (channel 8 s, a
# tick every 2 s), Holy Nova 48078, Mind Flay rank 9 48156 (3-s channel, tick
# spell 58381), Mind Sear 53023 (5-s channel, tick 53022 every 1 s).
# The warrior bot `ally` is the second ally of the Prayer of Mending checks.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Discipline
log Discipline - 900908 CONCEPT "mana burnt by mana burn transforms into a shiel for nearby allies (of the priest)": control - a Mana Burn on a Kobold Geomancer burns its mana and shields nobody
do pr learn 8129
do gm goto -285 150 -423.2
wait 300ms
as gm .npc add temp 476
wait 500ms
pick mb creature:476 near pr alive
require mb exists
do pr reset
# Mana Burn needs its target in front of the caster (result 134)
do pr approach mb
do pr cast 8129 on mb triggered
wait 500ms
expect pr noaura 900909
expect gm noaura 900909

log Discipline - 900908 with the passive the burnt mana becomes a Burnt Reserve (900909, 15 s) on the priest and on every party member within 30 yd of him - the director and the warrior bot too
do pr learn 900908
do pr reset
do pr approach mb
do pr cast 8129 on mb triggered
wait 500ms
expect pr aura 900909
expect gm aura 900909
expect ally aura 900909
expect pr auramaxduration 900909 == 15000
do gm target mb
as gm .npc delete
do gm target pr
as gm .unaura 900909
do gm target gm
as gm .unaura 900909
do gm target ally
as gm .unaura 900909

log Discipline - 900910 CONCEPT "inner fire also increases healing done by 1% per stack. max stacks increased to 50 but you loose 1 stack for every cast" (operator answer 8 a: lost only per cast, not when hit): control - a stock Inner Fire has 20 charges and loses them when a Combat Tester hits the priest in melee (8 s of hits: at least two land)
do pr learn 48168
do pr learn 48123
do pr learn 48071
do gm goto -285 150 -423.2
wait 300ms
as gm .npc add temp 11080
wait 500ms
pick ct creature:11080 near pr alive
require ct exists
do gm target pr
as gm .unaura 48168
as gm .unaura 900911
do pr reset
do pr cast 48168 on pr triggered
wait 500ms
expect pr auracharges 48168 == 20
expect pr noaura 900911
do pr approach ct
do pr cast 48123 on ct triggered
wait 8s
expect pr auracharges 48168 <= 18

log Discipline - 900910 with the passive Inner Fire has 50 charges (the +30 charge modifier), carries the healing aura 900911, and the Combat Tester's melee hits take nothing: 6 s of hits and still 50
do pr learn 900910
expect pr spellmod 48168 charges 20 == 50
do gm target pr
as gm .unaura 48168
wait 500ms
expect pr noaura 900911
do pr cast 48168 on pr triggered
wait 500ms
expect pr auracharges 48168 == 50
expect pr aura 900911
wait 6s
expect pr auracharges 48168 == 50

log Discipline - 900910 every spell the priest casts (not triggered) costs one charge: a Flash Heal = 49
do pr reset
wait 1700ms
do pr cast 48071 on pr
wait 2500ms
expect pr auracharges 48168 == 49
expect pr aura 900911

log Discipline - 900910 the healing aura goes with Inner Fire
do gm target pr
as gm .unaura 48168
waitfor pr noaura 900911 timeout 3s
expect pr noaura 900911
do gm target ct
as gm .npc delete
do pr reset
do gm target pr

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Holy
log Holy - 900945 CONCEPT "prayer of mending healing +50%": the heal 33110 (family flags1 0x20) reads +50 %
expect pr spellmod 33110 damage 100 == 100
do pr learn 900945
expect pr spellmod 33110 damage 100 == 150

log Holy - 900946 CONCEPT "... and it jumps to 2 allies (only if they dont have the buff yet)": the priest, the director and the warrior bot form the group; the bot is 3000 down, so the core's own jump goes to it. Control - without the passive the priest does not get the buff
do pr learn 48113
do pr reset
do gm target ally
as gm .damage 3000
do gm target pr
wait 300ms
do pr cast 48113 on gm
wait 500ms
expect gm aura 48111
do gm cast 16534
wait 1s
expect ally aura 48111
expect pr noaura 48111
do gm target gm
as gm .unaura 48111
do gm target ally
as gm .unaura 48111
do gm cast 25840 on ally triggered

log Holy - 900946 with the passive the same Prayer of Mending, hit on the director, lands on the warrior bot (the core's jump) AND on the priest (the second jump): both carry it
do pr learn 900946
do pr reset
wait 1700ms
do gm target ally
as gm .damage 3000
do gm target pr
wait 300ms
do pr cast 48113 on gm
wait 500ms
expect gm aura 48111
do gm cast 16534
wait 1s
expect ally aura 48111
expect pr aura 48111
do gm target gm
as gm .unaura 48111
do gm target ally
as gm .unaura 48111
do gm target pr
as gm .unaura 48111
do gm cast 25840 on ally triggered
do gm cast 25840 on gm triggered

log Holy - 900947 CONCEPT "divine hymn also unleases holy waves of light damaging all enemies in range dependent on paragon level": control - a Divine Hymn without the passive casts no wave
do pr learn 64843
do pr learn 48078
do pr goto -270 150 -423.2
wait 500ms
do pr reset
do pr cast 48078 triggered
do pr cast 64843
wait 2500ms
do pr stop
wait 500ms
expect pr spell 900948 casts == 0

log Holy - 900947 with the passive every Hymn tick (every 2 s, 8 s) casts a wave of light (900948) that hits the enemies in combat within 40 yd: the ring kept in combat by a Holy Nova before each tick - at least 3 waves, each on the 8 dummies for 666 + 5 x Paragon level Holy damage
do pr learn 900947
do pr reset
wait 1700ms
do pr cast 48078 triggered
spelllog start
do pr cast 64843
wait 1900ms
do pr cast 48078 triggered
wait 2000ms
do pr cast 48078 triggered
wait 2000ms
do pr cast 48078 triggered
wait 2000ms
do pr cast 48078 triggered
wait 800ms
spelllog stop
do pr stop
expect pr spell 900948 casts >= 3
expect pr spell 900948 maxtargets >= 6
expect pr spell 900948 damage >= 9000

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Shadow
log Shadow - 900978 CONCEPT "casting mind flay increases the damage and speed of the next mind flay by 25%. stacks 2 times. 10sec duration": control - a Mind Flay with the passive unlearned leaves no buff
do pr learn 48156
do pr goto -279 150 -423.2
wait 500ms
do pr approach d1
do gm target pr
as gm .unaura 900979
do pr reset
expect pr spellmod 58381 damage 100 == 100
do pr cast 48156 on d1
wait 3500ms
expect pr noaura 900979

log Shadow - 900978 with the passive a finished Mind Flay leaves one stack of Quickened Flay (900979: +25 % damage on the tick spell 58381, the tick period and the channel x0.83 - op 19 and op 1 -17 %), a second makes it two, a third stays at two; 10 s
do pr learn 900978
do pr reset
do pr cast 48156 on d1
wait 3500ms
expect pr aurastacks 900979 == 1
expect pr spellmod 58381 damage 100 == 125
expect pr spellmod 48156 19 1000 == 830
expect pr spellmod 48156 duration 3000 == 2490
expect pr auramaxduration 900979 == 10000
wait 1s
do pr cast 48156 on d1
wait 3s
expect pr aurastacks 900979 == 2
expect pr spellmod 58381 damage 100 == 150
expect pr spellmod 48156 duration 3000 >= 1979
expect pr spellmod 48156 duration 3000 <= 1981
wait 1s
do pr cast 48156 on d1
wait 3s
expect pr aurastacks 900979 == 2
as gm .unaura 900979

log Shadow - 900980 CONCEPT "mind sear +3 targets" (operator answer 5 a: three more Mind Sears on enemies near the target): control - a 5-s Mind Sear channel on d1 casts its tick (53022) once a second, 5-6 times
do pr learn 53023
do pr reset
spelllog start
do pr cast 53023 on d1
wait 6s
spelllog stop
do pr stop
expect pr spell 53022 casts >= 4
expect pr spell 53022 casts <= 6

log Shadow - 900980 with the passive every tick casts the tick spell on three more enemies near d1 as well: four casts a tick, 16 or more in the channel
do pr learn 900980
do pr reset
wait 1700ms
spelllog start
do pr cast 53023 on d1
wait 6s
spelllog stop
do pr stop
expect pr spell 53022 casts >= 16

cleanup
do pr stop
do gm target pr
as gm .unlearn 900907
as gm .unlearn 900944
as gm .unlearn 900977
as gm .unlearn 900908
as gm .unlearn 900910
as gm .unlearn 900945
as gm .unlearn 900946
as gm .unlearn 900947
as gm .unlearn 900978
as gm .unlearn 900980
as gm .unaura 900909
as gm .unaura 900911
as gm .unaura 900979
as gm .unaura 48168
as gm .unaura 48111
